WEBVTT

00:38:26.663 --> 00:38:31.454
And they understand this from that turned
out to be in some ways horrifying

00:38:31.454 --> 00:38:32.704
and extraordinarily

00:38:33.746 --> 00:38:38.663
damaging. Is that a meaningful sort of
canary in the coal mine saying, look out,

00:38:38.663 --> 00:38:40.746
humanity, this could be really dangerous?

00:38:40.746 --> 00:38:44.413
And how how on earth do you
protect against those

00:38:45.579 --> 00:38:46.579
kinds of unintended consequences?

00:38:47.454 --> 00:38:49.454
I think you raise a great
point in general,

00:38:49.454 --> 00:38:53.996
which is these systems don't have to wish
ill to humanity to cause ill just when

00:38:53.996 --> 00:38:58.413
you have, like, very powerful systems. I
mean, unintended consequences for sure.

00:38:58.746 --> 00:39:02.288
But another version of that is
